WEBVTT

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:21.432
When guys like you can't use your powers,
you become useless pieces of shit.

00:02:25.728 --> 00:02:26.729
You know it's pointless.

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:29.899
As an ex-inmate of Supermax,
you should know that.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.154
Hey!

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:41.327
Oh, I was just…

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:44.706
Tell the pilot that I'll be riding along.

00:02:44.789 --> 00:02:47.250
I was returning to HQ anyway,
so it's perfect timing.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.002
Roger. Come aboard.

00:02:49.085 --> 00:02:51.504
No. I already have a place to sit.

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:22.744
You sure do have bad luck,

00:03:22.827 --> 00:03:26.789
getting caught like that by a superhero
who happened to be vacationing in Florida.

00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:32.253
And he's the most powerful dude
in The Union of Justice, Gladiator.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.847
Oh, this must be the reception.

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:27.058
I've reserved a Cessna.

00:04:34.482 --> 00:04:35.900
It's the Cessna at the very back.

00:04:35.984 --> 00:04:39.404
It's still early,
so wait here until the boss arrives.

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:42.615
If you're free now,
why not ride with me in my Cessna?

00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:43.741
Hey!

00:04:43.825 --> 00:04:45.326
Something terrible has happened!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.911
The Cessna at the very back

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:49.664
suddenly started
and someone got caught in the propeller!

00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:52.417
-They're all calling for you!
-What?

00:04:53.001 --> 00:04:56.254
The engine started?
That's impossible! How could that happen?

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.427
-How did this happen?
-This guy's fucked up.

00:05:03.845 --> 00:05:07.515
For god's sake! I was just about
to hit it off with her too.

00:05:07.598 --> 00:05:10.018
Didn't look that way to me.

00:05:10.101 --> 00:05:13.730
It's my style
to warm up those icy cold types.

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:15.315
Oh, gramps…

00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:21.946
Hello, sexy baby.

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:25.575
Thank you.

00:05:26.951 --> 00:05:28.202
You're making me blush.

00:05:30.913 --> 00:05:33.291
This guy was the only one on the plane.

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:35.918
Okay, move him outside.

00:05:39.797 --> 00:05:40.840
Quit movin' around!

00:05:40.923 --> 00:05:44.177
I can't help it
until I grow my parts back!

00:05:45.136 --> 00:05:46.512
Hey there!

00:05:46.596 --> 00:05:47.597
There!

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:52.060
Mission commenced!

00:05:52.643 --> 00:05:54.812
Is electric boy's work done?

00:05:54.896 --> 00:05:56.314
No, it ain't.

00:05:56.397 --> 00:05:59.067
Yeah! Charge my phone for me, would ya?

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.446
I like that!

00:06:03.529 --> 00:06:05.198
Thunder fuck you!

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:08.159
Yo!

00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:13.998
My arm!

00:06:18.002 --> 00:06:20.296
It's grown back.

00:06:21.172 --> 00:06:22.173
I'm gonna puke.

00:06:23.299 --> 00:06:25.301
That's how beautiful life works, man!

00:06:35.436 --> 00:06:38.481
Nice! Being in the cockpit sure is fine!

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:41.484
<i>You're cleared for takeoff
from runway nine.</i>

00:06:42.026 --> 00:06:45.279
Cleared for takeoff
from runway nine. Copy.

00:06:48.449 --> 00:06:52.411
Don't be nervous, boy. Just follow
my directions and all will go well.

00:06:52.495 --> 00:06:54.914
Nervous? Not in the least.

00:06:55.498 --> 00:06:57.458
No matter how long
a pilot has been flying,

00:06:57.542 --> 00:07:01.838
there are times where you'll lose track
of where the sky and the land are.

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:03.214
To keep that from happening,

00:07:03.297 --> 00:07:07.051
I always calmly observe everything
and check the instruments.

00:07:07.718 --> 00:07:08.594
Oh, really?

00:07:08.678 --> 00:07:11.055
That's my style.

00:07:11.722 --> 00:07:12.557
Here.

00:07:13.266 --> 00:07:16.394
That's the wiring plan
for the other airplane. Study it well.

00:07:17.395 --> 00:07:18.354
Yeah.

00:07:20.231 --> 00:07:23.734
Don't compare your powers
with other people's powers, Johnny.

00:07:23.818 --> 00:07:27.447
What's important is
to find your own style.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:29.532
Don't you worry, Carmine.

00:07:30.199 --> 00:07:32.910
I was born with nothing but style.

00:07:32.994 --> 00:07:34.412
Carmine?

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.831
I am The Heat.

00:07:38.499 --> 00:07:40.918
<i>Welcome aboard, Super Crooks!</i>

00:07:41.586 --> 00:07:46.048
<i>You good-for-nothing scum!
Don't you dare fasten those seatbelts!</i>

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:48.134
-All right!
-All right!

00:07:59.687 --> 00:08:01.898
<i>Kasey, we've just taken off.</i>

00:08:18.247 --> 00:08:19.499
Static electricity?

00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:24.670
Looks like this will be a smooth flight.

00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:25.838
We'll see.

00:08:25.922 --> 00:08:28.257
A bird just might
smash into the windshield.

00:08:29.634 --> 00:08:31.177
There was an accident like that once.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.845
Roger! Watching out for birds.

00:08:40.228 --> 00:08:41.812
We're within range.

00:08:41.896 --> 00:08:44.482
Can you deactivate
the restraint device TK's in?

00:08:44.565 --> 00:08:48.319
No can do. The device itself
renders all powers useless.

00:08:48.402 --> 00:08:51.364
Roger. Okay, you bums,
we're going with plan B.

00:08:51.447 --> 00:08:52.365
<i>Roger!</i>

00:08:52.949 --> 00:08:54.075
<i>Plan B. Okay!</i>

00:08:55.576 --> 00:08:57.245
They're way too relaxed about this.

00:08:59.455 --> 00:09:01.832
Four hours until arrival at Supermax.

00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.793
We're conveying one supervillain.

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:05.294
Provide security on landing.

00:09:05.962 --> 00:09:09.966
<i>Supermax. Security on landing. Copy.
What is the supervillain's numb…</i>

00:09:10.925 --> 00:09:12.218
What?

00:09:14.512 --> 00:09:15.846
What happened?

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.308
Talking time is over!

00:09:20.017 --> 00:09:22.311
Gramps, I've shut down
their communications.

00:09:24.522 --> 00:09:27.441
Boys, time to get this party started!

00:09:30.611 --> 00:09:33.030
Don't you guys have villain suits?

00:09:33.114 --> 00:09:34.574
What? A suit?

00:09:34.657 --> 00:09:37.285
Even a million of those
wouldn't be enough!

00:09:37.368 --> 00:09:39.537
They'll see your face
if you don't have a mask.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.331
Don't you like my face, pal?

00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:45.501
Josh, have you ever thought about
how it feels to be a person with a face

00:09:45.585 --> 00:09:48.170
that no amount
of plastic surgery can change?

00:09:54.552 --> 00:09:57.221
When we're on a mission,
my name's The Ghost.

00:09:57.305 --> 00:09:59.932
I don't want to be around you anyway!

00:10:00.808 --> 00:10:03.811
I hate your guts, Ghost!

00:10:27.668 --> 00:10:29.253
Hello there!

00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:56.030
<i>Ghost! I got rid of the troublemaker!</i>

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:18.344
What?

00:11:19.428 --> 00:11:20.554
It's a ghost.

00:11:26.727 --> 00:11:28.604
Sammy, see you in heaven.

00:11:47.706 --> 00:11:49.625
You're pretty good at hiding.

00:11:50.209 --> 00:11:52.253
Who the heck are you?

00:12:13.941 --> 00:12:15.192
Dammit!

00:12:15.276 --> 00:12:18.571
That's some brutal treatment
for someone you've just met.

00:12:18.654 --> 00:12:20.948
I'm actually quite shy, you know.

00:12:22.032 --> 00:12:25.744
Your kind of power
is the kind I hate most of all!

00:12:52.938 --> 00:12:55.274
TK, right? I'm with The Heat.

00:12:58.652 --> 00:12:59.862
Communication is out!

00:13:00.362 --> 00:13:01.906
It's gotten quiet in the back.

00:13:02.615 --> 00:13:04.450
You think they all got taken out?

00:13:07.369 --> 00:13:08.871
You guys don't have guns, right?

00:13:15.794 --> 00:13:17.671
You think Gladiator got taken out too?

00:13:18.339 --> 00:13:19.298
I don't know.

00:13:19.882 --> 00:13:21.675
If he's all right,
he should be able to save us.

00:13:23.093 --> 00:13:24.762
Hitting a bird
is the least of our worries.

00:13:34.063 --> 00:13:34.897
Hurry!

00:13:35.397 --> 00:13:37.066
Let's get as close as we can to Supermax.

00:13:37.608 --> 00:13:38.484
Yes, sir!

00:13:40.903 --> 00:13:43.822
They're speeding up.
Can you slow them down, Johnny?

00:13:44.907 --> 00:13:46.200
That's a silly question.

00:13:50.496 --> 00:13:51.330
Damn!

00:13:51.413 --> 00:13:53.707
For some reason, it's not speeding up!

00:13:53.791 --> 00:13:54.667
You're kidding!

00:13:56.752 --> 00:13:59.797
We're done for! They'll take us out too!

00:14:01.549 --> 00:14:03.050
Hurry it up, boys!

00:14:03.133 --> 00:14:05.344
Johnny can't keep this up forever.

00:14:05.427 --> 00:14:08.681
This is a piece of cake, gramps.

00:14:08.764 --> 00:14:11.058
I'll show you what my style is like.

00:14:32.454 --> 00:14:36.166
Scum like you with nothing
but your powers are a plague on society!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.960
That sure is mean.

00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:40.671
How dare you
judge someone just by their looks?

00:14:45.009 --> 00:14:46.927
<i>Roddy! How are things on your end?</i>

00:14:48.596 --> 00:14:51.181
<i>Ghost, hurry up and free TK!</i>

00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:53.392
<i>How can he without the code?</i>

00:14:53.475 --> 00:14:56.020
<i>The Ghost is a notorious safecracker.</i>

00:14:56.103 --> 00:14:58.856
<i>If anyone
can deactivate that lock, Josh can.</i>

00:15:00.566 --> 00:15:02.443
You'll never deactivate it.

00:15:02.526 --> 00:15:03.861
Give it up.

00:15:03.944 --> 00:15:08.115
Once we arrive
at Supermax, you're through!

00:15:17.791 --> 00:15:20.085
Not more bad luck!

00:15:20.169 --> 00:15:21.962
No, this is good luck.

00:15:22.046 --> 00:15:22.880
What?

00:15:44.693 --> 00:15:48.739
The problem with you villains
is how you use your powers.

00:15:49.323 --> 00:15:53.661
Scum like you who resort to easy crimes
without making any effort or determination

00:15:53.744 --> 00:15:55.704
don't deserve to breathe
the air of this world!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.301
That got in my mouth!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.492
I'll crush your skull.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.525
Don't think you've won!

00:17:06.608 --> 00:17:08.193
Even if I fall from this height,
I won't die!

00:17:10.112 --> 00:17:14.825
All you ever do is talk about yourself.
I bet you've got no friends!

00:17:15.492 --> 00:17:17.786
I've got lots of friends!

00:17:43.854 --> 00:17:47.399
At last! He's here!
Mommy! Daddy! It's a hero!

00:17:47.483 --> 00:17:49.234
My goodness! How wonderful!

00:17:49.318 --> 00:17:51.361
At last, this day has arrived!

00:17:51.445 --> 00:17:52.738
Everyone!

00:17:53.947 --> 00:17:57.743
Oh, great Gladiator,
won't you please save our kingdom?

00:17:58.452 --> 00:18:00.829
<i>Ever since that day</i>

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:03.332
<i>Everything</i>

00:18:03.415 --> 00:18:07.878
<i>Changed</i>

00:18:08.587 --> 00:18:12.883
<i>To our ocean, darkness--</i>

00:18:12.966 --> 00:18:14.134
Enough!

00:18:31.193 --> 00:18:32.402
Fine.

00:18:32.945 --> 00:18:36.448
I'll save your kingdom. Take me there.

00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:48.710
It will be a difficult fight.

00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:49.920
Are you prepared for it?

00:18:50.587 --> 00:18:52.548
I've trained for this a long time!

00:19:12.651 --> 00:19:15.112
Roddy! Get me one of those beers!

00:19:16.655 --> 00:19:17.489
Where's the hero?

00:19:23.245 --> 00:19:26.248
That overly self-conscious defender
of justice idiot got what he deserves!

00:19:26.832 --> 00:19:29.501
Kasey, what kind of dream is he having?

00:19:29.585 --> 00:19:32.212
He's dreaming of becoming
the hero of a mermaid kingdom.

00:19:33.338 --> 00:19:35.757
Heat, everything here is going fine.

00:19:38.343 --> 00:19:39.178
Heat?

00:19:45.475 --> 00:19:46.560
We're almost there!

00:19:46.643 --> 00:19:47.769
Dear God!

00:19:50.898 --> 00:19:52.399
Ghost! Hurry it up!

00:19:56.486 --> 00:19:57.529
Hey!

00:19:58.071 --> 00:19:58.906
What?

00:19:58.989 --> 00:20:00.657
Tell me the deactivation code!

00:20:00.741 --> 00:20:02.743
No way!

00:20:05.537 --> 00:20:07.873
It's no good! I can't deactivate it!

00:20:07.956 --> 00:20:10.667
The guards won't tell me either.
Why would they?

00:20:10.751 --> 00:20:14.588
When we get to Supermax, you're through.

00:20:15.172 --> 00:20:17.299
Heat! We've failed!

00:20:17.382 --> 00:20:20.385
We can't fly this thing
and if we'll get caught anyway,

00:20:20.469 --> 00:20:22.221
let's not hurt these guys anymore so--

00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:23.805
<i>Then go to plan C!</i>

00:20:27.851 --> 00:20:29.102
Plan C?

00:20:31.897 --> 00:20:33.357
There's no plan C!

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:37.778
Hey!

00:20:37.861 --> 00:20:39.238
Get closer!

00:20:39.321 --> 00:20:41.031
What? What are you doing?

00:20:41.531 --> 00:20:43.158
This is plan C!

00:20:43.242 --> 00:20:46.119
Don't do it, Johnny!
We'll crash into them!

00:22:38.273 --> 00:22:43.278
Subtitle translation by: Brian Athey
